    <!-- Robot screen: maps sheet -->
    <string name="robot_maps_intro">The maps stored on your robot. The robot keeps one backup of each map: back it up while the map looks right, and restore it if the map goes wrong. Moved the dock somewhere the map doesn't cover? Delete the map, then let the robot map the home again.</string>
